@startuml sequence_telemetry_tmpfs
!include ../../../design/theme.iuml

title Telemetry tmpfs Write-Read-Ack Sequence (ADR-0037)

actor Client
participant "Command\nGoroutine" as CmdGoro
participant "Slot Tracker" as Tracker
participant "Drain Worker" as Drain
participant "Tmpfs Writer\n(mmap)" as Writer
database "/dev/shm file" as Shm
participant "Socket" as Sock
participant "Plugin\nSocket Reader" as PluginSock
participant "Plugin\nTmpfs Reader" as PluginReader
participant "Context\nReconstructor" as Recon
participant "OTLP Exporter" as OTLP

== Operation recording (unchanged, zero-alloc) ==
Client -> CmdGoro : RESP command
CmdGoro -> Tracker : RecordTelemetry(TelemetryRecord)
note right of Tracker
  Records stored as compact binary
  in slot ring. Zero heap allocation
  on the command hot path (ADR-0034).
end note

== Drain (NEW: protobuf serialize, no materialization) ==
Tracker -> Drain : completed operation
activate Drain
Drain -> Drain : serialize entire operation\nas TelemetryOperation protobuf
note right of Drain
  Whole operation to ONE protobuf message:
  - operation_id
  - initial_context: Tag[] from
    VisitConnectionContextVersion
    (snapshot at OpStart, no map alloc)
  - all telemetry items (records)
  - context deltas as Tag fields
  - NO map allocation
  - NO string conversion
  - NO materialize function calls
end note
Drain -> Writer : write serialized\nTelemetryOperation protobuf
Writer -> Shm : mmap write (~200ns)
deactivate Drain

== Plugin self-drive (polling) ==
PluginSock -> Sock : poll for readable range
Sock --> PluginSock : readable range {offset, length}
activate PluginSock

== Plugin read (at plugin's own pace) ==
PluginSock -> PluginReader : wake, read at offset
activate PluginReader
PluginReader -> Shm : pread(offset, length)
PluginReader -> Recon : serialized TelemetryOperation\nmessages (whole operations)
activate Recon

loop for each whole TelemetryOperation
  Recon -> Recon : deserialize protobuf\n-> op_id + initial_context + items
  Recon -> Recon : seed context from\ninitial_context Tags
  Recon -> Recon : iterate telemetry items
  alt ContextUpdate / ContextRemove item
    Recon -> Recon : apply Tag delta\non top of initial_context
  else OperationStart item
    Recon -> Recon : confirm context state\nmachine initialized
  else CommandStart / CommandFinish item
    Recon -> Recon : track command boundary
  else OperationFinish item
    Recon -> Recon : finalize context map
    Recon -> OTLP : convert to OTLP span + logs
  end
end

deactivate Recon

== Ack and truncate ==
PluginReader -> PluginSock : read complete
deactivate PluginReader
PluginSock -> Sock : TelemetryAck{consumed_offset}
deactivate PluginSock
Sock -> Writer : truncate consumed bytes
Writer -> Shm : ftruncate / advance offset

note over CmdGoro, Tracker
  The command hot path is completely
  unchanged from ADR-0034. Zero allocation.
end note

note over Drain, Writer
  The drain path is radically simplified.
  No event bus, no plugin bridge, no router
  FIFO, no transport.SendBatch for telemetry.
end note

note over PluginSock, OTLP
  The plugin owns all context reconstruction
  and OTLP conversion. No concurrent client
  connections — full CPU budget available.
end note

@enduml
